          "text": "Following [1.4.268](https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/tag/v1.4.268), here is the next round of Orca. Bots learn eight more agents, and the phone app catches up with the desktop. ## Bots on eight more agents, a fuller phone & a quieter Mac ✨ Bots can now run on Kiro, Kimi Code, Auggie, Gemini CLI, Kilo Code, MiMo Code, Droid and Goose, Chat opens more agents directly, and the phone app can answer, approve and set up almost everything the desktop can. - 🤖 **Run bots on more agents:** Bots can run on Kiro, Kimi Code, Auggie, Gemini CLI, Kilo Code, MiMo Code, Droid and Goose. Chat can ope…"
        },
        {
