          "version": "v1.4.268",
          "text": "We shipped more than one release today. Check out [1.4.267](https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/tag/v1.4.267) and [1.4.266](https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/tag/v1.4.266) too. ## Bots on more agents, richer Slack & a faster Orca ✨ Bots can now run on Cursor, GitHub Copilot and Hermes, Slack gets scheduling and canvases, and Orca does less work in the background so it feels quicker. - 🤖 **Run bots on more agents:** Bots can run on Cursor, GitHub Copilot and Hermes, and OpenCode 2.x bots get their standing instructions. New bots get an identity card, and Soul & Memory have redesi…"
